		(company "Ricardo Quesada")
		(comment 1 "Wireless Gamepad, Paddle & 1351 Mouse Adapter for Commodore 64")
		(comment 2 "Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W (RP2350 + CYW43439) - Low-Power & CIA/SID-Protected")
		(comment 3 "License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0)")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Unipad C64 - Hardware Architecture\n- Wireless Inputs: Bluetooth Gamepads, C64 1351 Analog Mouse, 1311/1312 Paddles & Rumble\n- MCU: Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W (RP2350 + CYW43439, Dual BR/EDR + BLE, PIO State Machines)\n- Power: <45mA from C64 +5V via 250mA PTC Polyfuse + Ferrite Pi-Filter + DMG2305UX Ideal Diode\n- Analog Emulation: 10k POTX/POTY pull-ups + 10k/22k (2.62V) 5V-safe SYNC dividers + 74HCT05"
